    {
      "id": "39394160-b18b-4fae-8c0b-d402f5ccc70f",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "function soma(a, b) {\n  return a + b;\n}\n\nconsole.log(soma(3, 4));",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "0cad592f-094a-47e8-869b-24dd2bb3eb2f",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "É possível criar funções com parâmetros opcionais",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "9012c022-b1a0-4002-b81e-9387534240e0",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "function soma(a, b = 0) {\n  return a + b;\n}\n\nconsole.log(soma(3));",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "86963fc2-0ac3-4389-b7e0-0d1871ac3d56",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "let digaOla = function () {\n  console.log('Olá');\n};\n\ndigaOla();\n\nconst idade = 16;\nlet bemVindo;\nif (idade < 18) {\n  bemVindo = function () {\n    console.log('Olá');\n  };\n} else {\n  bemVindo = function () {\n    console.log('Saudações');\n  };\n}\n\nbemVindo();",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c288bbdf-2c7c-452c-90b0-82c57b85080a",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const soma = (a, b) => a + b;\nconsole.log(soma(3, 4));\n\nconst dobro = (n) => n * 2;\nconsole.log(dobro(4));\n\nconst digaOla = () => console.log('Olá');\ndigaOla();\n\nconst sayHello = (_) => console.log('Hello');\nsayHello();\n\nconst subtracao = (a, b) => {\n  const resultado = a - b;\n  return resultado;\n};\nconsole.log(subtracao(10, 8));",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "68c9d9b9-4a5a-43f7-a073-df054f6b39bd",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n\n",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "3120e653-72c6-4072-b464-467e23f1f2c8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Uma característica importante das ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Arrow Functions",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " é que não se pode declarar paramêtros com o mesmo nome na sua definição",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "7425c93b-a7ee-4bb1-8187-df3cd1eeb77a",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "O Spread Operator é representado por três pontos ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "...",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " e converte um array em elementos individuais.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "f9c04c0d-4890-4195-ad0a-81d37b6284e2",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const meuArray = [1, 2, 3];\nconsole.log(meuArray);\nconsole.log(...meuArray);\nconsole.log([...meuArray, 4, 5, 6]);",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "19872cca-b202-4d8a-9f8f-3b1b7208731d",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Podemos utilizar os mesmos recursos para objetos. Com ele, duplicamos seus valores em um novo objeto.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "bf686cee-6d39-4735-880f-23f1b29b3e1a",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const data = { firstName: 'Leonardo', lastName: 'Bragatti' };\nconsole.log({ ...data, email: 'email@email.com' });",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "eec3afc9-055f-45bd-a6b8-54a261edcba8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A técnica de Destructuring permite a quebra de estrutura complexas em partes únicas.\nÉ possível aplicá-la em Arrays e Objetos:",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "4343f1fc-88e1-4d91-8fee-81cd91f9e2a3",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const meuArray = ['azul', 'vermelo', 'verde'];\nconst [cor1, cor2, cor3] = meuArray;\n\nconsole.log(cor1);\nconsole.log(cor2);\nconsole.log(cor3);\n\nconst meuObjeto = { x: 10, y: 20, z: 30 };\nconst { x, y } = meuObjeto;\n\nconsole.log(x);\nconsole.log(y);",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "4253602f-d66d-40d4-b2f0-d205c79a39cd",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Javascript não tem uma implementação robusta de orientação a objetos. Mas é possível criar objetos no seu código.\nObjetos em Javascript pode ser criados sem uso de classes, criando estruturas em tempo de execução.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b966fc90-189c-4ce2-a7bc-abc1eff114e3",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const carro1 = { marca: 'Fiat', modelo: '500', cor: 'Branco' };\nconst carro2 = { marca: 'Fiat', modelo: '500', cor: 'Branco' };\n\nconsole.log(carro1);\nconsole.log(carro1.marca);\nconsole.log(carro1.modelo);\nconsole.log(carro1.cor);\n\nconsole.log(carro2);\nconsole.log(carro2.marca);\nconsole.log(carro2.modelo);\nconsole.log(carro2.cor);",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c14fffb1-ee3e-413b-adda-af08f7047a9f",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Definindo objetos com declaração literal.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "04a3c5fa-f817-4655-b20b-2d2714de8a18",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const pessoa = {\n  nome: 'Mario',\n  sobrenome: 'de Andrade',\n  id: 4483,\n  nomeCompleto: () => {\n    return `${this.nome} ${this.sobrenome}`.trim();\n  },\n};\nconsole.log(pessoa);\nconsole.log(pessoa.nomeCompleto());",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "6f32ceea-3690-4e24-abc1-dcb1d4da8993",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Instância de objetos a partir de implementação vazia",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "d984c589-1483-4415-b719-edd42827a984",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const criarNovaPessoa = (nome) => {\n  const obj = {};\n  obj.nome = nome;\n\n  obj.saudacao = () => {\n    console.log(`Olá, ${obj.nome}`);\n  };\n\n  return obj;\n};\n\nconst pessoa = criarNovaPessoa('Ale');\npessoa.saudacao();",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dca6840c-be47-41b3-b578-f51ea1dbe7a4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Instância de objetos utilizando função que representa uma classe e o operador ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "new",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "64717f2e-62a8-4310-bea1-62e1ed6bf726",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "function Pessoa(nome) {\n  this.nome = nome;\n  this.saudacao = () => {\n    console.log(`Olá, ${this.nome}`);\n  };\n}\n\nconst pessoa = new Pessoa('Ale');\npessoa.saudacao();",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2362701a-a960-45db-a526-97f7340f5622",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "É possível escrever códigos orientados a objetos de forma clara, com sintaxe parecida com outras linguagens de programação",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c1df370f-bb7f-4677-82e2-22be7b07be56",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "class Pessoa {\n  // Constructor\n  constructor() {\n    this.nome = '';\n    this.email = '';\n  }\n}\n\nconst pessoa = new Pessoa();\npessoa.nome = 'João';\nconsole.log(pessoa.nome);",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "8f803945-ee13-4675-9a50-2b9ae28d77ba",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Javascript não possui modificadores de visibilidade: público, privado ou protegido.\nPara deixar claro que algo é privado, usamos o ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "_",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " (underline) antes do nome do atributo e manipulamos seu valor através de métodos ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "get",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " e ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "set",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "3282d69b-429a-4733-8029-c83a3fdafeb3",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "class Pessoa {\n  // Constructor\n  constructor() {\n    this._nome = ''; // \"privado\"\n  }\n\n  get nome() {\n    return this._nome;\n  }\n\n  set nome(value) {\n    this._nome = value;\n  }\n}\n\nconst pessoa = new Pessoa();\npessoa.nome = 'João'; // Sem a sintaxe do metódo\nconsole.log(pessoa.nome);",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "585f0621-f0b0-44f0-b3ad-867ca877e542",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "É possível definir métodos estáticos",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "6412b19f-f678-48a0-af7a-85fca5f0daec",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "class Pessoa {\n  // Constructor\n  constructor(nome) {\n    this._nome = '';\n  }\n\n  get nome() {\n    return this._nome;\n  }\n\n  static qualClasseSou() {\n    console.log('Sou a classe Pessoa.');\n  }\n}\n\nconst pessoa = new Pessoa('Ale');\nPessoa.qualClasseSou();",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "eab356bc-2856-4e5e-b5fa-511c54069123",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Utilizando herança de objetos",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "21ccb5b2-7f28-4954-943c-b5cda60d4a7c",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "class Carro {\n  constructor(marca) {\n    this.marca = marca;\n  }\n}\n\nclass SUV extends Carro {\n  constructor(marca, tipoCambio) {\n    super(marca);\n    this.tipoCambio = tipoCambio;\n  }\n}\n\nconst suv = new SUV('Honda', 'Automatico');\nconsole.log(suv.marca);\nconsole.log(suv.tipoCambio);",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "0de0440e-f433-4f5c-9922-1d740b561782",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Módulos são pedaços de códigos JavaScript escritos em um arquivo de modo que seja possível usar apenas um trecho deste arquivo dentro de outro arquivo.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "09096a27-4bb3-4957-bfda-1b31b95e00cf",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Eles podem ser exportados de forma nomeada ou forma default.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "4c792b2b-fd14-43e2-8f95-131461e2ffbe",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Dentro de outro arquivo, eles serão importados, podendo usar a técnica de ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Destructuring",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ".",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "bb974677-9bcd-4950-81bb-06fe379e6097",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Isso facilita a componentização do código, deixando-o mais organizado e legível.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "623b81ff-3cd0-48bf-8bbb-d5a8a28de5c7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Classes, funções e variáveis presentes em um arquivo podem ser exportadas de\nforma nomeada. Ex: arquivo ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "MeuModulo.js",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "5195c8b0-1d0a-4618-9858-fdc8256ea8ca",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "class MinhaClasse {\n  show() {\n    console.log('Um metódo dentro da classe');\n  }\n}\n\nconst minhaFuncao = (_) => console.log('Uma função');\nconst minhaVariavel = 10;\n\nexport { MinhaClasse, minhaFuncao, minhaVariavel };",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "4a816060-cbe4-4722-b9f4-b3cd8f18d1f5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Para importar somente a MinhaClasse do arquivo ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "MeuModulo.js",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " dentro do ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "index.js",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "609f1ff0-2525-4b34-ba59-8c6b1ad16fa3",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import { MinhaClasse } from './MeuModulo.js';\n\nconst a = new MinhaClasse();\na.show();",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "4314fdb6-f516-4172-afbe-3873adef62d9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Para executar usando o NodeJS, sem o uso do Babel, adicione a linha ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", conforme abaixo, no arquivo ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "package.json",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dfc72926-7142-4736-8670-b7e95f2984e1",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "json"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{\n  \"name\": \"Teste\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"main\": \"index.js\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"echo \\\"Error: no test specified\\\" && exit 1\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [],\n  \"author\": \"\",\n  \"license\": \"ISC\"\n}",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "f2be828c-b567-4feb-bdfa-c2be110ab9a9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Módulos podem ter um ",
          "styles": {}
